WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
An agent has power. Power needs direction.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Give it a method. Skillify. Engineering skills for AI coding agents.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:22.000
orientify. Find your bearings. Trace a real flow. Name the seams and traps.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:28.000
undumbify. Make intent complete. Supply decisions. Ask only what changes the outcome.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:34.000
researchify. Find what holds up. Official sources first. State confidence and gaps.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.000
traceify. Find the cause. Falsify hypotheses before making the smallest fix.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:46.000
audify. Measure the condition. Set the standard. Reproduce every finding.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:52.000
shapeify. Make work executable. Name the files, checks, dependencies and traps.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:58.000
promptify. Fit the model. Set outcome, effort, scope and stop rules.

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:06.000
shipify. Build. Check. Prove. Set a baseline. Verify each step and the real result.

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:12.000
reviewify. Judge against intent. Located findings. Concrete fixes. One verdict.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:18.000
releaseify. Release honestly. Version from the diff. Rollback before deploy.

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:24.000
teachify. Make understanding last. Match the learner. Explain, practise and check.

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:36.000
Eleven disciplines. One method.

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:39.500
scout. Find the exact path. Read only. Return files, flow and the first file to open.

00:01:39.500 --> 00:01:43.000
researcher. Bring the evidence. Read and web. Return sources, confidence and gaps.

00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:46.500
worker. Execute the contract. Edit within scope. Establish a baseline and verify.

00:01:46.500 --> 00:01:50.000
reviewer. Make an independent call. Read only. Located findings and one verdict.

00:01:50.000 --> 00:02:00.000
Intent. Evidence. Judgment. Understand before changing. Prove before claiming.

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:10.000
Skillify. Better agents. Deliberate engineering. github.com/trykA123/skillify
